# ─── Backend API base URL ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Local dev: leave unset — api-client.ts auto-derives it from the current host
# (e.g. http://localhost:8080 → http://localhost:4000/api/v1).
#
# Production (Vercel): set this to your deployed Render backend's public URL,
# with the /api/v1 suffix. Add it in Vercel → Project → Settings →
# Environment Variables (Production/Preview/Development as needed), then
# redeploy — Vite only reads VITE_* vars at build time.
VITE_API_URL=https://your-backend-service.onrender.com/api/v1
